 | access-date=5 December 2010
}}</ref> The organism was isolated and [[pure culture|cultured]] beginning in 2009 from samples she and her colleagues collected from sediments at the bottom of [[Mono Lake]], California, U.S.A.<ref name = "Thriving"/> Mono Lake is [[hypersaline]] (about 90&nbsp;grams/liter) and highly [[alkaline]] ([[pH]] 9.8).<ref name=Oremland2003>{{cite journal
